  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "c3edf8cc-566e-7f03-7bc6-d6bbda02a93b",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"text-block-75\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"b4d22988-ac82-e384-ee81-d962ae948e2a\">Boosts focus &amp; performance</strong> – Natural energy with L-theanine for mental clarity<br data-w-id=\"9f0124c1-f58c-6c82-e334-d8021758cf08\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"0b0da796-c8e1-cc4e-fb02-258c601135f9\">Healthy employee perk</strong> – Vegan, antioxidant-rich, and wellness-focused<br data-w-id=\"074ffb4d-c603-89b4-9e7d-cfa108b47b22\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"a4569f13-621b-cc04-fdbb-0d2b402e679f\">Modern &amp; inclusive</strong> – Fits every lifestyle: dairy-free, gluten-free, plant-based<br data-w-id=\"3ef832e7-c080-7697-fec9-db5679e1c742\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"e109df6c-deb1-e72b-b11c-55811e3c5ce5\">Positive office culture</strong> – Show your team you care with better beverages</div>",
    "text": "✔️ Boosts focus & performance – Natural energy with L-theanine for mental clarity\n✔️ Healthy employee perk – Vegan, antioxidant-rich, and wellness-focused\n✔️ Modern & inclusive – Fits every lifestyle: dairy-free, gluten-free, plant-based\n✔️ Positive office culture – Show your team you care with better beverages"
   },
