   "id": "09ed1faa-f038-8aeb-9737-f67d5cc69b66",
   "text": {
    "html": "<div class=\"text-block-75-2\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"1ba703f3-c532-f4e9-82b1-f901019b7958\">Premium matcha for professionals</strong> – High-quality and easy to prepare<br data-w-id=\"4971bf54-06c0-aaa9-6af4-833a0aeb0fcb\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"f9424bec-7aab-232f-898b-ee044f2ee43d\">Trusted B2B supplier</strong> – Flexible solutions for offices of all sizes<br data-w-id=\"4246f4cc-f5b2-093b-edba-339b71310ed0\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"8f5d6bf8-7a89-048c-89c4-7504236a43af\">Healthier workplace culture</strong> – Support energy, focus, and employee wellness<br data-w-id=\"560cc021-a953-823c-a19d-e6aa0b13e05e\">✔️ <strong data-w-id=\"e2b345f4-4ab6-6a8a-dd01-9393e9dc2e02\">Simple setup</strong> – We help you get started with the right tools and blends</div>",
    "text": "✔️ Premium matcha for professionals – High-quality and easy to prepare\n✔️ Trusted B2B supplier – Flexible solutions for offices of all sizes\n✔️ Healthier workplace culture – Support energy, focus, and employee wellness\n✔️ Simple setup – We help you get started with the right tools and blends"
